<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 248-3 V MIDDLESEX (305) - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 248-3 V MIDDLESEX (305) - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, replying to Middlesex's first innings total of 305, were 248 for three at tea on the second day of the three-day tour match on Sunday.</p>
</text>
